	(text "USB-C J5: CC1/CC2 5.1k Rd (R28/R29, UFP, default USB power). U11 USBLC6-2SC6 at the receptacle clamps D+, D- and VBUS.\nJ9 microSD (Hirose DM3AT-SF-PEJM5): VDD = +3V3_SD (U4, EN_SD). R23..R27 47k pull-ups on CMD and DAT0..DAT3. C24 10 uF + C25 100 nF at the socket. Card detect -> SD_CD (IO8, internal pull-up).\nR56 33R series damping on SD_CLK at the MCU. No discrete ESD diodes on the SD lines (cost cut): the socket shell is GND, keep the enclosure closed; touching the card contacts is the ESD exposure.\nBefore switching +3V3_SD off set CLK/CMD/DAT to input or low so the GPIOs do not back-power the card."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 34.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b8177276-0c78-5e9c-93ad-0c6606f5f331")
	)
	(text "USB-C receptacle (UFP, 5.1k Rd) and USBLC6-2SC6 ESD array at the connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 45.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01a72418-39d6-5d3e-8d61-57a378cc350a")
	)
	(text "microSD (4-bit SDIO) on the switched +3V3_SD rail, SD_CLK damping (no discrete ESD diodes: cost cut)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 45.18 0)
		(effects
